; The underwater backdrop (src/worlds.c builds the water's light, the surface, the caustics, the shafts, the kelp and the
; fish): on a sandy floor under clear blue water, light from the rippling surface overhead falling in shafts and
; dancing over the sand in caustics, kelp swaying either side, a school of fish turning slowly in the distance,
; bubbles rising.

